  "description": "Stay Strong's best ever frame, just got even better! Introducing the 2024 For Life V5 Stay Strong frame. The Expert sized frames feature a 1-1/8th head tube, Euro bottom bracket and 10mm rear dropouts (10mm enclosed dropouts on disc frames). The Expert frame uses a 22.2mm seat post which reduces weight, but then we added a few little tweaks. The main addition being a stiffer and stronger downtube, allowing a \"Pro\" size look and feel but without compromising on the weight or design. With every new frame come new and improved water decals and logos. With the V5 being no exception... Welcome to the \"STY STRG CODE\" (lots of hidden messages to find across the frame). The other obvious difference is the fade out colour schemes, giving you not one but two colours per frame. The V5 is our best looking and performing frame to date. ###section### Product Specs\nMATERIALAluminium\nTOP TUBE LENGTH19.5\"\nHEAD TUBE ANGLE73°\nSEAT TUBE ANGLE70°\nCHAIN STAY LENGTH13.3\" - 14.3\"\nBB HEIGHT269.2mm\nWHEEL SIZE20\" STANDOVER HEIGHT\nDROPOUT SIZE10mm\nHEADSET TYPEIntegrated\nBB TYPEEuro\nSEAT TUBE DIAMETER22.2mm BRAKE MOUNTS\nWEIGHT1232g (2.71lbs) ###section### Product Highlights BMX Racing specific geometry Race specific frame Strong and lightweight aluminium construction Butted tubing for added strength Integrated chain tensioners",
